---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: "GTA 6 Waypoints: Map, Collectibles, Trophies & 100%"
description: "When GTA 6 unlocks in your store region: live countdown and the midnight wave. Then the map, collectibles and 100% checklists, verified in-game."
updated: 2026-10-26
---
<div class="wrap home">
  <section class="hero" aria-labelledby="home-h1">
    <p class="kicker">GTA 6 · Thursday 19 November 2026</p>
    <h1 id="home-h1"><span class="vh">GTA 6 </span><span class="l1">Completion</span> <span class="l2">companion.</span></h1>
    <p class="hero__sub">The GTA 6 map, collectibles, trophies and 100% checklists, verified in-game. Opening on launch day.</p>
    {% set cdSize = "home" %}{% include "partials/countdown.njk" %}
  </section>

  <section class="home-section" aria-labelledby="wave-h">
    {% set waveSize = "home" %}{% include "partials/unlock-wave.njk" %}
  </section>

  {%- set latest = collections.news | limit(3) %}
  {%- if latest.length %}
  <section class="home-section" aria-labelledby="latest-h">
    <div class="home-section__head">
      <h2 id="latest-h">Latest</h2>
      <a href="/news/">All news →</a>
    </div>
    <ul class="latest">
      {%- for n in latest %}
      <li><time datetime="{{ n.date | isoDate }}">{{ n.date | shortDate }}</time><a href="{{ n.url }}">{{ n.data.title }}</a>{% if n.data.status %}{% badge n.data.status %}{% endif %}</li>
      {%- endfor %}
    </ul>
  </section>
  {%- endif %}

  <section class="cta" aria-labelledby="cta-h">
    <div class="cta__band" aria-hidden="true">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 1440 400" preserveAspectRatio="none" focusable="false">
        <defs>
          <radialGradient id="cta-glow" cx="50%" cy="55%" r="55%"><stop offset="0" stop-color="#EE4B83" stop-opacity="0.22"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#EE4B83" stop-opacity="0"/></radialGradient>
          <linearGradient id="cta-g1" x1="0" x2="1"><stop offset="0" stop-color="#EE4B83"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#9B5CF0"/></linearGradient>
        </defs>
        <rect width="1440" height="400" fill="url(#cta-glow)"/>
        <path d="M0 120 C 300 60, 520 200, 760 150 S 1200 60, 1440 110" fill="none" stroke="url(#cta-g1)" stroke-opacity="0.35" stroke-width="1.5"/>
        <path d="M0 210 C 280 260, 560 140, 820 200 S 1220 280, 1440 220" fill="none" stroke="#EE4B83" stroke-opacity="0.22" stroke-width="1.5"/>
        <path d="M0 290 C 320 240, 600 330, 900 290 S 1260 230, 1440 300" fill="none" stroke="#9B5CF0" stroke-opacity="0.25" stroke-width="1.5"/>
        <path d="M0 250 C 360 300, 640 210, 980 250 S 1300 320, 1440 260 L 1440 400 L 0 400 Z" fill="#9B5CF0" fill-opacity="0.06"/>
      </svg>
    </div>
    <div class="cta__card">
      <div>
        <h2 id="cta-h">Be there on opening day</h2>
        <p>One email the moment GTA 6 unlocks in your region, then the day-one guide drop. No spam.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        {% set signup = { cta: true, region: "hidden", button: "Get the unlock alert" } %}{% include "partials/email-signup.njk" %}
        {% set shareUrl = "/" %}{% set shareLabel = "Share the countdown" %}{% include "partials/launch-actions.njk" %}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</div>
